<Slide
  style={{
    width: '1280px', height: '720px',
    background: '#F5F7FA',
    padding: '20px 60px',
    fontFamily: '"思源黑体", sans-serif',
  }}
>
  <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: '100%' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FF9F1C', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 2, marginBottom: 8 }}>MONITOR & DEBUG</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#16263F', fontWeight: 'bold', marginBottom: 24 }}>监控与日志：看得见，才调得动</Text>
    <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 4, background: '#22D3EE', marginBottom: 26 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24, flex: 1 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 14, padding: '26px 24px', boxShadow: '0 2px 12px rgba(22,38,63,0.06)' }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 56, borderRadius: 14, background: '#EAF2FB', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center', marginBottom: 16 }}>
          <FAIcon name='chart-line' style={{ fill: '#22D3EE', width: 28, height: 28 }} />
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16263F', marginBottom: 8 }}>LangSmith 链路可视化</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>
          Trace 追踪每一步的输入输出、耗时与 token，瓶颈一眼定位。
        </Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 14, padding: '26px 24px', boxShadow: '0 2px 12px rgba(22,38,63,0.06)' }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 56, borderRadius: 14, background: '#EAF2FB', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center', marginBottom: 16 }}>
          <FAIcon name='list' style={{ fill: '#22D3EE', width: 28, height: 28 }} />
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16263F', marginBottom: 8 }}>set_verbose 详细日志</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>
          打印完整执行过程，看中间步骤的输入输出，快速定位问题环节。
        </Text>
        <Box style={{ marginTop: 12, background: '#F5F7FA', borderRadius: 8, padding: '10px 14px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#22D3EE', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", monospace' }}>langchain.verbose = True</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#16263F', borderRadius: 14, padding: '26px 24px' }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 56, borderRadius: 14, background: 'rgba(255,159,28,0.15)', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center', marginBottom: 16 }}>
          <FAIcon name='bug' style={{ fill: '#FF9F1C', width: 28, height: 28 }} />
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', marginBottom: 8 }}>set_debug 底层调试</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#DCE7F5', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>
          输出底层提示词、原始响应与 token 统计，深度排查兜底手段。
        </Text>
        <Box style={{ marginTop: 12, background: 'rgba(34,211,238,0.12)', borderRadius: 8, padding: '10px 14px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#22D3EE', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", monospace' }}>langchain.debug = True</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 14, left: 60, right: 60, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>AI 从零开始 · 第 4 讲</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>12 / 14</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
